settings-live.patch (LUCY-wqn96 L4): route settings.json hook commands through the live export.

Apply ONLY after scripts/git-hooks/install.sh has run (run-gate must exist):
  patch -p1 -d ~/.claude < ~/.claude/scripts/git-hooks/settings-live.patch
Generated 2026-10-24T18:45Z by scripts/git-hooks/make-settings-patch.py against the LIVE settings.json
(it may differ from committed main). If it no longer applies, regenerate it:
  python3 ~/.claude/scripts/git-hooks/make-settings-patch.py > /tmp/settings-live.patch

- PreToolUse guards get --fail-exit 2: Claude Code blocks on exit 2 and only warns on any
  other code, so a drifted export must block, not wave the tool through.
